                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Ya hussain , ya hussain , ya hussain , ya hussain<br />
Haye!! Aseer qafila darbar e sham jab aaya,<br />
Yazeed (LA) Zainab-e-Kubra (SA) se yun huwa goya<br />
Lo aj raaz &ldquo;Wa tu izzu man tasha&rdquo; ka khula<br />
Ke ba weqaar hua kon, kon hai ruswa</p>

<p>O! Bad kalam theher, O! Bad kalam theher, Bolen Zainab-e-Kubra (SA)<br />
